  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SEE-Clean Cooking: Support to the WCA Alliance for the African Biodigester Component (ABC) &#x2013; Bridging Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The West and Central African Alliance (WCA Alliance) for biodigesters is an initiative of eight African Heads of States and Governments to accelerate biodigester uptake in the region.The WCA Alliance advises its member states on the necessary conditions required for their biodigester markets to flourish. Hivos East Africa, as the WCA Alliance Support Implementer for the African Biodigester Component (ABC) programme, provides support to the WCA Alliance and its member governments to carry out their mandate.</narrative>
  </description>
